1
00:00:08,909 --> 00:00:10,389
T-minus 60 seconds!

2
00:00:10,544 --> 00:00:12,354
It all comes down to this!

3
00:00:13,247 --> 00:00:14,657
(Leonard:)I've got butterflies.

4
00:00:14,815 --> 00:00:16,525
(Sheldon:)Don't get soft on me, Hofstadter.

5
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:18,683
(Sheldon:)I will slap those glasses
right off your face.

6
00:00:21,655 --> 00:00:22,655
(Penny:)What's going on?

7
00:00:22,823 --> 00:00:24,773
(Leonard:)Hey. We're about
to buy tickets for Comic-Con.

8
00:00:26,894 --> 00:00:28,274
T-minus 45 seconds!

9
00:00:28,428 --> 00:00:30,838
(Leonard:)They sell out incredibly fast,
but as long as one of us gets in....

10
00:00:30,998 --> 00:00:33,408
(Sheldon:)Good Lord, this is not the time
for flirting! Keep it in your pants!

11
00:00:35,335 --> 00:00:37,615
It's a whole lot
of weird before coffee.

12
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:40,212
T-minus 30 seconds!

13
00:00:40,374 --> 00:00:42,754
(Raj:)Oh, I have to go
to the bathroom so bad.

14
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,890
Every year!
I told you, wear a diaper!

15
00:00:45,045 --> 00:00:46,545
And I told you I get diaper rash!

16
00:00:46,713 --> 00:00:47,883
15 seconds!

17
00:00:48,048 --> 00:00:50,388
Oh, this is it!

18
00:00:53,287 --> 00:00:54,787
(Leonard:)This is it.

19
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:57,792
(Howard:)Five, four, three,

20
00:00:57,958 --> 00:00:59,268
(Howard:)two, one.

21
00:00:59,426 --> 00:01:00,876
It's live. Go! Go! Go!

22
00:01:08,068 --> 00:01:09,068
(Raj:)Anyone in?

23
00:01:09,236 --> 00:01:10,616
-No!
-Not yet!

24
00:01:11,905 --> 00:01:13,745
Do not stop refreshing your screens!

25
00:01:13,907 --> 00:01:15,577
(Sheldon:)-Refresh.
-Refresh.

26
00:01:15,742 --> 00:01:17,952
(All(repeatedly):)Refresh. Refresh....

27
00:01:20,647 --> 00:01:26,027
(Penny:)Yeah, this is not
gonna be enough coffee.

